# The Release Console image's own ignore file (BuildKit uses it instead of the root
# .dockerignore for this Dockerfile). It sends Docker only what the console's three
# packages need, so the build never walks the shop's node_modules: everything is
# left out, then the workspace files and the console's packages are let back in.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!turbo.json
!tsconfig.base.json

!apps/release-console/
!apps/release-console-api/
!packages/release-console-contracts/

# Never sent, even inside the console's packages: installed modules, build output,
# caches, local data and anything that holds keys.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.angular
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/.env
**/.env.*
